{
  "id": "news-skip-01",
  "title": {
    "en": "Skipping the Trade Before a Release",
    "bn": "Release-এর আগে trade এড়ানো"
  },
  "symbol": "EURUSD",
  "timeframe": "M5",
  "mode": "synthetic",
  "type": "trade-setup",
  "bias": "neutral",
  "outcome": "no-trade",
  "tags": [
    "news",
    "no-trade",
    "event-risk",
    "stop-hunt"
  ],
  "module": "11-fundamental-intermarket-analysis",
  "lessonSlugs": [
    "06-news-trade-avoid-korbo"
  ],
  "caption": {
    "en": "Synthetic EURUSD M5. A tidy-looking range sits just before high-impact data. The release sweeps about 45 pips up, then about 75 pips down within two candles. Staying out avoids a stop that no placement could survive.",
    "bn": "কাল্পনিক EURUSD M5। উচ্চ-প্রভাবের data-র ঠিক আগে পরিষ্কার দেখতে range। Release-এ দুই candle-এ প্রায় 45 pip ওপরে, তারপর প্রায় 75 pip নিচে। বাইরে থাকলে এমন stop এড়ানো যায় যা কোনো জায়গাতেই টিকত না।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "A setup that looks clean can still be exposed to event risk.",
    "bn": "দেখতে পরিষ্কার setup-ও event risk-এর মুখে থাকতে পারে।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "No trade is a valid decision before data",
      "bn": "Data-র আগে trade না নেওয়াও সঠিক সিদ্ধান্ত"
    }
  ],
